---
source: tests/cli_help_snapshot_tests.rs
description: gpy theme
expression: help
---
Manage themes

Usage: gpy theme <COMMAND>

Commands:
  list      List available themes
  use       Switch to a theme
  show      Show current theme
  new       Create new theme from template
  save      Save the currently active theme's contents as a theme file
  validate  Validate a theme by name or file path (defaults to active theme)
  import    Import a `starship.toml` into a GPY palette + prompt theme
  help      Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
  -h, --help  Print help
